.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZMORNING 1
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zmorning
.Nd print a daily zdots context brief and launch the task picker
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -brief | Fl -pi
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints date, machine context, AI status, database status, git state, and
in-flight backlog count. By default it then launches
.Xr zdash 1
when available.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Fl
.It Fl -brief
Print the brief only.
.It Fl -pi
Skip the brief and open Pi for conversational orientation.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
.It Ev ZDOTDIR
Repository root.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CONTEXT
Machine context label.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE
AI operating mode.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT
AI server base URL.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr agent-guide 1 ,
.Xr zdots-status 1 ,
.Xr ztask 1
